Install fonts

Triplicate font in gdrive:
https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iuFGZSlMMklUBF9uSJ06p7PWREQi7JXR/view?usp=sharing

https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts

The homebrew fonts repo got migrated and might be broken:
https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-cask
https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-cask-fonts/tree/master/Casks
https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-cask/tree/master/Casks/font.

$ brew tap homebrew/cask            # you only have to do this once!
$ brew tap homebrew/linux-fonts     # you only have to do this once!
$ brew install font-fira-code-nerd-font
-or-
$ brew install --cask font-fira-code-nerd-font

Maybe just google the latest issue in github if the above doesnt work
